== Trivia ==
[[File:Sculk Portal BE1.png|thumb|width=154x154|The unused reinforced deepslate texture, which is still used in ''China Edition''.]]
* In ''[[China Edition]]'', a variant of reinforced deepslate exists containing a hole in its texture.
* According to [[Brandon Pearce]], reinforced deepslate's purpose is to add mystery.<ref>{{tweet|GhirkinThe|1496948460628545539|Could you maybe explain what's up with reinforced deepslate? Like why rank it an S?|February 24, 2022}}<br>{{tweet|kingbdogz|1496948660684439554|People are talking about it a lot, which shows it did its job of adding mystery.|February 24, 2022}}<br>{{tweet|GhirkinThe|1496949392229601281|Interesting|February 24, 2022}}</ref>
* Despite being unobtainable in-game, in ''[[Craft Your Own Adventure: Wild Tales]]'' there is a path where the player is able to mine and obtain it.<ref>{{mcnet|craft-your-own-adventure--wild-tales/north#minereinforceddeeplsate|North|June 2, 2022|Sofia Dankis, Cristina Anderca, Sophie Austin, and Per Landin}}</ref>
* Reinforced deepslate is the hardest block in ''Minecraft'', with 55 hardness.

